    "faq_hLAJCg": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_pzWUFd": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why use auto incline training?",
            "content": "<p>Auto incline training helps you make workouts more effective by <strong>increasing resistance and engaging more lower body muscles</strong>, especially the legs and glutes.</p><p>It also allows you to <strong>burn more calories in less time</strong> compared to flat walking or running, making your home workouts more efficient and goal-focused. 🔥</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_rHWMfG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between auto incline and manual incline?",
            "content": "<p>Auto incline can be <strong>adjusted directly during your workout using buttons or preset programs</strong>, making it more convenient and dynamic.</p><p>Manual incline needs to be <strong>adjusted by hand before use</strong>, and usually stays at a fixed level during the workout.</p><p>In short, auto incline is more flexible and easier to control while exercising. 👍</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_m8faKz": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "🎁 Order Early for a Stress-Free Holiday (Christmas Tips)",
            "content": "<p>Buying early means your gift won’t arrive late — and even if the recipient prefers something else, you’ll still have time to switch to a perfect Plan B.<br/>Ordering now also helps you avoid holiday shipping delays and ensures your treadmill arrives well before Christmas.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_BRUW3W": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can beginners use incline treadmills?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, beginners can absolutely use incline treadmills.</p><p>It is recommended to start with a <strong>low incline level and slow speed</strong>, then gradually increase intensity as your fitness improves. This helps make workouts more comfortable and easier to adapt to over time. 👍</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_dV3fYa": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is incline training harder on knees?",
            "content": "<p>No, incline walking is generally <strong>low-impact and joint-friendly</strong> when done at a comfortable speed and moderate incline level.</p><p>It can actually feel more natural for some users compared to running on flat surfaces, especially when used for <strong>walking and light cardio workouts</strong>. 👍</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_ncbddz": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is auto incline worth it?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, auto incline is worth it if you want a more efficient and engaging workout.</p><p>It allows you to <strong>increase intensity easily during exercise</strong>, helping you burn more calories and vary your training without stopping or adjusting the machine manually. 🔥</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_aypwLE": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long is the warranty for WELLFIT products?",
            "content": "<p>All WELLFIT treadmills and walking pads come with a <strong>1–3 year warranty</strong>, depending on the specific model. We stand behind the quality of our products and are here to support you long after your purchase.</p><p>For full details, please visit our official <a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/warranty-policy\"><strong>Warranty Policy</strong></a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_anHVP9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to pay extra for shipping or taxes?",
            "content": "<p><strong>No, you don't.</strong> All WELLFIT products come with <strong>free shipping and no additional taxes, </strong>consumers <strong>do not need to pay the 7%-15% sales tax</strong>. The price you see on our website is the final price — no hidden fees at checkout.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_dd3C3D": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How soon will I receive my order after purchase?",
            "content": "<p>We ship from <strong>7 U.S. warehouses</strong> located in <strong>California, Georgia, Texas, New Jersey, Houston, and New York. </strong>Most orders are delivered within <strong>1–5 business days</strong>, depending on your location.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
